---
layout: base.njk
pageType: blog
title: Blog
description: Notes on manufacturing, factory automation and robotics from Japan.
permalink: /blog/
---
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Manufacturing and tech, from Japan</h1>
    <p>Short notes on factory automation, robotics and the Japanese industrial market.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    {% if collections.posts.length %}
    <ul class="posts">
      {% for post in collections.posts %}
      <li><a href="{{ post.url }}">
        <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
        <div lang="{{ post.data.lang or 'en' }}">
          <h2>{{ post.data.title }}{% if post.data.lang and post.data.lang != 'en' %}<span class="lng">{{ post.data.lang | langName }}</span>{% endif %}</h2>
          {% if post.data.description %}<p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>{% endif %}
        </div>
      </a></li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    {% else %}
    <p class="empty">No posts yet.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
